ou type, based on your past notes. 3 · Search in photos Find handwritten words inside the pictures you capture.\n\nFieldnote suggests tags as you type, based on your past notes. Find handwritten words inside the pictures you capture.\n\nUpdate Fieldnote\n\nUpdate Fieldnote\n\nQuestions? Just reply — a real human reads every email.\n\n— Ines & the Fieldnote team\n\nFieldnote 1200 Harbor Way, Seattle, WA 98101 You’re receiving this because you signed up at fieldnote.example.com. Unsubscribe · Update preferences · View in browser","slices":29,"renderCalls":[{"page":"faXLwhxkT8PtjuWB","scale":2,"transparent":false,"skip":[]}]}
